<div class="toplang">
<p><span>Idiomas disponibles: </span><a href="../de/rewrite/avoid.html" hreflang="de" rel="alternate" title="Deutsch">&nbsp;de&nbsp;</a> |
<a href="../en/rewrite/avoid.html" hreflang="en" rel="alternate" title="English">&nbsp;en&nbsp;</a> |
